      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "<b>Hi!</b>\nWe are the <b>BCI Busters</b>, and we need your help to clear the path!\nReach the flag before the clock runs out:\n\u2022  Move Kris with A / D and jump with W.\n\u2022  Stop at an obstacle and press S: it awakens the power of Kris's sword, the dark fountain opens and a flashing pad appears.\n\u2022  Focus on the pad: the power of your focus calls upon <b>Noelle</b> for water, <b>Ralsei</b> for trees or <b>Susie</b> for boxes, to help you overcome the obstacle you are standing at.\n<b>The faster you finish, the higher your score!</b>"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
